       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\n- **Dose:** Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum for adults of 3,200 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg in one dose is also twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks:** A dose this high raises the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function and no allergies don't change that.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions.\n- **400\u2013800 mg by mouth, 3 times daily**, a more typical range.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into 400 mg four times daily.\n\nTell me the dose you want and I'll enter it. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that it's intentional and give the clinical rationale. I'd also suggest checking with pharmacy before I enter it."
